{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415700","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415700","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041570001:1":{"text":"はあ、面倒くさい……これだから仕事は嫌いなんだよねぇ。","source_cn":"啊，真是麻烦……我讨厌工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF14C7AB646EC4CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570002:1":{"text":"ああ、誤解しないでおくれ。特定の業務や書類のことじゃなくて、ボクは仕事そのものが嫌いなんだ。","source_cn":"别误会，不是说具体的某件任务或者某份文件——我讨厌工作本身。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7BF637FC750F562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570003:1":{"text":"同感だ。","source_cn":"同感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E6156CD9628EB55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570004:1":{"text":"へえ、これは驚いた。てっきりキミもインドラみたいに、仕事が好きすぎてそれを他人にまで期待するような仕事人間だと思ってたよ。","source_cn":"咦？！真让人意外。我还以为你和因度厄一样，都是个热爱工...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A281688E11C13A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570005:1":{"text":"そんなことはない。\n私は純粋に責任感だけで、今の役職と仕事を担っている。","source_cn":"并非如此。\\n我承担目前的职责与工作，完全是出于责任心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0000EB1E067DE7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570006:1":{"text":"他にやれる者がいない今、私が手を引けば、たちまち面倒なことになるからな。","source_cn":"如果我撒手不管，那么就无人可做，一切就会变得一团混乱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x377721930ED70A61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570007:1":{"text":"だが、私の責任感にも限界はある。機会があればいつでも、本来これを担うべき者に譲るつもりだ。","source_cn":"但我必须声明，这份责任心绝非无限，只要有机会，我会希望...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98EEB59EF5CF4DF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570008:1":{"text":"――権力と責務、そして終わりの見えない仕事もろともな。","source_cn":"——无论是权力，职责，还是无穷无尽的工作本身。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DCBB8DBE6EAF3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570009:1":{"text":"素晴らしい。他人の言葉だけでキミの性格を判断したボクが間違っていたようだ。","source_cn":"说得妙极了，我真不该凭着他人的三言两语就错判了你的个性。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47527F5AE0E5B2CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570010:1":{"text":"それに、ボクと同じくマスクを愛用しているようだし……キミとは話が合いそうだよ。","source_cn":"仔细瞧瞧，你也是个面具爱好者——我是说，我感觉我们会聊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67455EE90889E5F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570011:1":{"text":"どうだい、もう少し静かな場所に移って、今後の改善策について、じっくり話し合わないかい？","source_cn":"不如我们换个更安静的地方，聊聊如何改善情况的详细计划，如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF40EFADA1387F3EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570012:1":{"text":"けっこうだ。計画はすでに考えてある。ただ、それを実行に移す機会がないだけだ。","source_cn":"不，这无需多谈，我早就有了详细的计划，只是缺少实施机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5898B9F2A850F5B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570013:1":{"text":"まず、二人が旅から戻るのを待つ。次に、彼らを捕まえて、それぞれの持ち場に縛り付ける。","source_cn":"第一步：等那两个在外游历的家伙回来。第二步：把他们捉住...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F4D0BDC83782C8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570014:1":{"text":"そして私は、責任感の及ぶ範囲でだけ責任を負い、あとは穏やかな人生を満喫する――というものだ。","source_cn":"第三步：以我有限的责任心，承担属于我的有限的责任。第四...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB282D5971A35D48E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570015:1":{"text":"……だが今のところ、二人を捕まえようとする度に、毎回うまいこと理由を作っては逃げられてしまう。","source_cn":"目前来说，我尽管想执行第二步，但他们总在我来得及执行前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA528BCE007703BF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570016:1":{"text":"…………\nそれは、実に残念だねえ。","source_cn":"…………\\n啊呀，这听起来真是不幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x450D87E6AD7272FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570017:1":{"text":"まったくだ。\nそういえば以前、インドラ殿がこういう時の対処法に心得があると言っていた。","source_cn":"确实。\\n不过幸好，此前闲聊时，因度厄曾说过，在这方面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A59978005B6D883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041570018:1":{"text":"彼にコツを伝授してほしいと頼んだのだが、まだ返事をもらえていなくてな……","source_cn":"因此，我曾向他请教过相关的经验，但他好像还没回信……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9168572DB10E4488","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041570019:1":{"text":"……あ～\nそれはそうと、羽の生えた美しいお連れさんの前で話すには、少々重すぎる話題じゃないかな？","source_cn":"……呃……\\n说起来，我亲爱的朋友，这种话题在你这位长...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5FFB5059E54A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041570020:1":{"text":"せっかくお互い綺麗なマスクをつけているんだし、もう少し気楽な話をしようじゃないか。","source_cn":"看在咱们共同的漂亮面具的份上，换个轻松的话题吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DF74496B9CB5ED9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docu